'''Shirou Emiya''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. He was added in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]].

